# Flat status UI + font weight (frontend + CMS)

## Status indicators — no glossy orbs

Never use glossy, 3D, bubble, or skeuomorphic status dots anywhere in `frontend/` or `cms/`.

### Forbidden

- Glossy / gradient / shadowed circular status orbs
- Emoji status chrome: 🟢 🟡 🔴 🔵 ⚫ ⚪
- Radial gradients, inset highlights, or drop-shadows on tiny status circles

### Required

- Flat solid `StatusDot` (`frontend/src/components/shared/status-badges.tsx`) — solid `bg-*` only
- Or semantic `Badge` variants
- Always pair color with a text label (e.g. “Online”)

## Typography — use font weight, not only size

Do not build hierarchy with `text-*` sizes alone. Status labels, titles, and emphasis must use font weight.

### Scale (Tailwind)

| Role | Size | Weight |
|------|------|--------|
| Page title | `text-2xl` + `font-display` | `font-semibold` |
| Section / card title | `text-base` + `font-display` | `font-semibold` |
| Row / item title | `text-sm` | `font-medium` |
| Status label (Online, Synced, Failed) | `text-sm` | `font-medium` |
| Body / description | `text-sm` | default (normal) |
| Meta / timestamp | `text-xs` | default + `text-muted-foreground` |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — size only, no weight; glossy emoji
<span className="text-sm">🟢 Online</span>

// ✅ GOOD — flat dot + size + weight
<span className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium">
  <StatusDot tone="success" />
  Online
</span>
```

## Scope

Presence, sync, health, notifications, dashboards, CMS badges, and all new UI in both apps.
